  =
  \frac{t^{-ab(N^2-1)/4}}{t^{N/2}-t^{-N/2}}
  \sum_{\varepsilon=\pm1}
  \sum_{k=-(N-1)/2}^{(N-1)/2}
  \varepsilon
  t^{abk^2+k(a+\varepsilon{b})+\varepsilon/2}.$$

